        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist awakens in complete darkness, with no memory of how they got there.<br>A faint light in the distance is their only clue. As they follow it, they find something that shouldn't exist in this place—a toy from their childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> themed around memory and the mind.<br>As the player wanders through the pitch-black void, they encounter fragmented memories and eerie phenomena, slowly uncovering why they are here—and what they must do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches based on your choices, leading to multiple possible endings.<br>Experience a chilling journey through silence, shadows, and self-reflection.</p>",
